fenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br />using <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math><br />Thus, slope is negative.",
